---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { GUIDE_RATE } from '../data/consultancy.js';
---
<SiteLayout title="AEO Services and Implementation | Agenquest" description="Customer research, AI visibility assessments, content, technical fixes, review collection, and credible third-party evidence. Explore how Agenquest helps." wide={false}>
<div class="container service-copy"><h1>How we help your business get discovered through AI.</h1>
<p>We start with the people you want to reach, examine the information available about your business, and turn the gaps into a practical plan. You can work with us on diagnosis, implementation, and ongoing measurement.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p>
<section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="customers">Understand your customers</h2>
<p>Your target customers stay at the center of the work. We look at what starts their search, the alternatives they consider, the questions they ask, and the evidence they need before buying.</p>
<ul><li>Review existing customer feedback, reviews, support questions, and sales notes that you're comfortable sharing.</li><li>Map the buying journey and the different people involved in a decision.</li><li>Use interviews or short surveys when the existing information leaves important questions unanswered.</li><li>Translate what we learn into realistic questions and situations to test in AI.</li></ul>

</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">01 / What you get</span><p>a clear description of the customers and buying decisions the AEO strategy needs to serve.</p></aside></section><section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="assessment">Assess your AI visibility</h2>
<p>We examine where your business appears, how it is described, and when another option is recommended. We look at the sources visible in the answers and compare findings across repeated checks.</p>
<ul><li>Build a set of realistic discovery, comparison, and decision questions.</li><li>Agree which AI platforms and geographies matter for your customers.</li><li>Record observed answers, brand inclusion, factual errors, and cited sources.</li><li>Review competitors and public information to identify plausible gaps worth addressing.</li></ul>

</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">02 / What you get</span><p>an evidence-backed assessment and prioritized roadmap, with observations separated from hypotheses.</p></aside></section><section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="owned-content">Improve the content you own</h2>
<p>We make your website easier to understand and more useful to a potential customer. That includes content for AI discovery and traditional search, with enough care that a person actually wants to read it.</p>
<ul><li>Clarify service and product pages: who they're for, what they do, limitations, and reasons to choose them.</li><li>Improve existing posts and create useful articles, comparisons, and FAQs around real buying questions.</li><li>Make important facts consistent across your site and the other profiles you control.</li><li>Improve internal links, page organization, and the path from information to inquiry.</li></ul>

</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">03 / What you get</span><p>AEO, SEO, and human-optimized pages and posts, with agreed changes ready to publish or implement.</p></aside></section><section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="credibility">Build credibility beyond your website</h2>
<p>Your own website tells part of the story. We help identify where independent evidence, genuine customer feedback, and relevant partners could make the story more credible.</p>
<ul><li>Help you collect genuine reviews faster through clearer requests, sensible timing, easier submission paths, and follow-up.</li><li>Choose review platforms based on your customers and category rather than pushing every business toward the same site.</li><li>Identify relevant partners, directories, publications, and opportunities for useful expert contributions.</li><li>Develop original material and outreach that gives others a reason to mention or evaluate your business.</li><li>Support transparent participation in relevant communities where it is appropriate.</li></ul>

<p>We ask for honest reviews. No fake reviews, positive-only requests, or rewards for Google reviews. Independent publishers and reviewers retain their own judgment.</p>
</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">04 / What you get</span><p>a focused review and credibility program, with the opportunities, responsibilities, and activity tracked.</p></aside></section><section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="technical">Fix the technical foundations</h2>
<p>Useful content still needs to be accessible and consistent. We review the technical issues that could prevent a search engine, AI system, or customer from finding and understanding it.</p>
<ul><li>Check crawlability, indexing, important rendered content, and broken links.</li><li>Review canonical URLs, metadata, internal links, and relevant structured data.</li><li>Check product and service information for clarity and consistency.</li><li>Implement agreed changes directly or work with your developer, depending on access and scope.</li></ul>

</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">05 / What you get</span><p>prioritized fixes and a record of what changed. We won't sell a special markup trick as a guaranteed route into AI answers.</p></aside></section><section class="service-panel"><div><h2 id="measurement">Measure progress against the work</h2>
<p>We report what we changed and what happened afterward. Visibility and citations help diagnose progress, but the commercial goal is better customer acquisition and revenue.</p>
<ul><li>Repeat an agreed set of questions and preserve the answers behind the summary.</li><li>Track brand inclusion, recommendations, citations, and factual accuracy separately.</li><li>Review website referrals, inquiries, and downstream outcomes where the data allows.</li><li>Explain uncertainty and use new findings to revise the plan.</li></ul>

</div><aside class="service-output"><span class="eyebrow">06 / What you get</span><p>a practical progress review tied to completed work, with clear next priorities.</p></aside></section><h3>How an engagement begins</h3>
<p>Share your website. We review the public information and arrange a free 30-minute call to discuss initial findings and a working plan. If we agree there's useful work to do, we define the deliverables, responsibilities, timing, and estimate before starting.</p>
<p>Our current guide rate is around {GUIDE_RATE}. We offer exclusivity within your agreed niche, with the boundaries set before the engagement begins.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p></div>
</SiteLayout>
